The price control target for the full process of routine dental implant services in Henan Province, starting from February 10, is 4300 yuan. The total cost of the full process for a single routine dental implant shall not exceed 97% of the control target.
Dental implantation refers to a tooth replacement method where the upper dental prosthesis is supported and retained by a lower structure implanted in the bone tissue.
The staff from Zhengzhou University First Affiliated Hospital said that, for a conventional single-tooth implant, the price from implantation to final restoration is approximately 16,000 to 17,000 yuan.
Patient He Ying: After the new policy, the doctor told me that for my condition, the cost is about 8,000 yuan to less than 10,000 yuan, which is basically half the original cost.
Based on the current project, Henan Province has integrated and determined 15 oral implantation service price items, such as "implantation fee for a single tooth", and uniformly formulated the prices and medical insurance payment categories for public hospitals under provincial management. It has also canceled or adjusted the service price items for 20 medical services, such as dental implantation surgery.
Li Yunjie, Deputy Director of the Department of Medical Price and Bidding Procurement of the Zhengzhou Medical Security Bureau: The main beneficiaries are four parties. First, the medical insurance system, as its expenditure will decrease; second, hospitals will have less capital tied up, and patients may see an increase in the number of treatments; third, suppliers will gain a market. For patients, they are the ones who benefit the most. The cost of planting a tooth may be reduced by half or even more.
